<title>BARBADOS: CRICKET-RED STRIPE STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-RED STRIPE STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>BRIDGETOWN, Barbados 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Red Stripe Cup</p>
<p>standings after eighth round matches ending on Monday:</p>
<p>				     P   W   L   D   ND  Pts</p>
<p> Barbados			  8   5   1   2   0   96</p>
<p> Jamaica			   8   3   1   3   1   72</p>
<p> Trinidad and Tobago	   8   2   1   4   1   60</p>
<p> Leewards Islands		8   3   2   1   2   60</p>
<p> Guyana			    8   0   1   4   3   32</p>
<p> Windward Islands		8   0   7   0   1   19</p>
<p>Note: Windwards earned 15 points for three games in which</p>
<p>they led on first innings but were eventually beaten.</p>
</text>
